[I] No advertising

[T] noad is a program for advertising-detection in
[T] vdr-recordings. It uses the station-logos for the
[T] detetction and produces cutting-marks for the
[T] recording. You can use noad as a standalone-program
[T] or in conjunction with vdr (use option --recording in vdr).

[U] https://github.com/madmartin/noad/

[A] <theNoad@SoftHome.net>
[M] Michael Tross <michael@tross.org>

